<title>FRANCE: Canal Plus seen in Nethold link-up.</title>
<headline>Canal Plus seen in Nethold link-up.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-09-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>A suspension of trading in Canal Plus shares on the Paris bourse and similar action on Richemont AG of Zurich sparked speculation that a tie-up will be announced between the French firm and Nethold of the Netherlands, traders said.</p>
<p>Nethold is owned by Richemont and MCL-Multi Choice Ltd.</p>
<p>&quot;There are rumours coming from London about a link up between Nethold and CanalSatellite,&quot; said a Paris-based operator. CanalSatellite is a unit of Canal Plus.</p>
<p>Canal Plus officials were not immediately available for comment.</p>
</text>
